OL,3,GNEWSASafety camera vans to be used for
OL,4,Aseatbelt checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire Police safety camera
OL,7,Fvans will be used to monitor drivers
OL,8,Fand passengers not wearing seatbelts as
OL,9,Fpart of a week-long pilot scheme.
OL,11,FPeople detected during the trial, which
OL,12,Fstarts on Saturday, will receive
OL,13,Fwarning letters about the risks
OL,14,Fassociated with not wearing a seatbelt,
OL,15,Frather than face prosecution.
OL,17,FThe initiative is part of an
OL,18,Feducational project and will be
OL,19,Freviewed after the monitoring period.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
