OL,3,GNEWSASafety camera vans to be used for
OL,4,Aseatbelt checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said its decision to broaden
OL,7,Fenforcement activity followed an
OL,8,Fincrease in road casualties across
OL,9,FLeicester, Leicestershire and Rutland
OL,10,Fthis year.
